<Base title="Privacy" description="ATRS Engineering Consultants privacy information.">
<section class="hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">Privacy</span><h1>Privacy information.</h1><p>This page explains the basic approach to information submitted through the ATRS website.</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container prose"><h2>Information you submit</h2><p>If you contact ATRS by email or through the enquiry form, the information you provide may be used to understand your request, respond to you and prepare an appropriate proposal or follow-up.</p><h2>Website analytics and third parties</h2><p>This rebuilt site is designed to minimise unnecessary client-side scripts and external dependencies. Any analytics, forms or third-party services added later should be documented here before deployment.</p><h2>Data retention</h2><p>Information should be retained only for as long as reasonably necessary for the purpose for which it was submitted and for applicable business or legal requirements.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>For privacy questions, contact <a href="mailto:info@atrseng.co.ke">info@atrseng.co.ke</a>.</p></div></section>
</Base>